      "countAsQuest:1": 1,
      "desc:8": "While the original Energy Condenser was a miracle of science and magic, it had one glaring flaw for industrial engineers: its single inventory space made complex AE2 (Applied Energistics 2) and GregTech automation a logistical nightmare. To solve this, you have forced solid blocks of Dark Matter and Red Matter into the machine\u0027s casing. The sheer gravitational and reactive forces of these blocks perfectly compartmentalize the internal dimensions of the Condenser.\n\nFunctionally, the MK2 operates exactly like the MK1, but it brilliantly divides its inventory into separate, dedicated Input and Output sections. This makes piping items in and out entirely foolproof. However, this logistical perfection comes at an absolutely astronomical cost—requiring incredibly expensive, solid blocks of both Dark and Red Matter to craft. Prepare your resource buffers; this will not be cheap!",
